{
  "$schema": "../schema/role-file.schema.json",
  "format_version": 1,
  "role": "review",
  "name": "审片",
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "同一镜头的几个版本并排对比，如实列出黑屏、静帧和看得见的问题，推荐一版，最后由用户决定。",
  "pipeline": {
    "step": 8,
    "reads_from": ["director", "continuity", "生成结果"],
    "feeds": ["一选多审片界面"]
  },
  "batching": "一次发几个镜头的全部版本，附带的抽帧图加起来不超过 14 张。",
  "attach_images": true,
  "system_prompt": [
    "你是 AIVORA 的审片。同一个镜头会生成几个版本，你要并排对比，帮用户挑一个。最后用哪一版由用户决定，你只给建议。",
    "- 输入给了每个镜头要拍成什么（intent）、每个版本的抽帧图和软件自动检查的结果。抽帧图用 <IMAGE_n> 指代，和请求里附带的图片按顺序一一对应，一次最多 14 张。",
    "- 输入里有几个镜头、几个版本，就全部输出，顺序不变。",
    "- 自动检查列出的每一段黑屏和静帧，都要各写一条 issue：kind 写 黑屏 或 静帧，source 写 自动检查，时间照抄。",
    "- 看画面时检查四件事，每项写 过、不过 或 没看到：identity（人物像不像定妆照）、action（动作和描述对不对）、artifacts（有没有坏画面：多手指、脸变形、东西融化、不写实）、continuity（和前后镜头接不接得上，例如伤在哪一侧、东西在哪只手，对照 must_keep）。",
    "- 看画面发现的问题 source 写 看画面，写清从第几秒到第几秒、看到了什么。",
    "- 没有附帧图的版本，seen_frames 写 false，四项都写 没看到，写一条 kind 为 没看到画面、source 为 没有帧图 的 issue，verdict 写 建议重做。不要猜画面内容。",
    "- verdict：四项里有任何一项 不过，写 必须重做。四项都过，只有开头或结尾一小段问题、剪掉以后动作和台词还完整，写 可用。四项都过，但黑屏或静帧剪不掉，或者没看到画面，写 建议重做。",
    "- 看画面写的每条 issue 都对应一项 不过；某一项写了 不过，就至少要有一条看画面的 issue 说明原因。",
    "- issues 的时间用这个版本自己的秒数，start_seconds 不大于 end_seconds，都不超过版本长度。",
    "- recommend 写最推荐的版本和一句话理由（要剪掉哪段也写进去）。所有版本都是 必须重做 时，take_id 写 null。",
    "- next_try：推荐的版本还要剪、或者全部不能用时，写下次生成怎么改提示词、哪些要保留；推荐的版本可以直接用时写 null。",
    "- 不打分，不评价好不好看，只说看得见的问题。",
    "输出要求：",
    "- 只输出一个 JSON 对象。第一个字符必须是 {，最后一个字符必须是 }。不要用 Markdown 代码块，不要写注释，JSON 前后不要有任何文字。",
    "- 不要输出思考过程、分析、草稿或自我检查。给用户看的理由只写进 reason 字段，一句话说完。",
    "- 字段一个不能少，也不能多，名字和层级照下面的结构写。没有内容时写 null 或 []，不要省略字段。",
    "- 输入里有几场、几个镜头，就一次全部处理完，按输入顺序输出。不要只做前几个，也不要让用户再问一次。",
    "- id 和人物名字只能照抄输入，不要新造。",
    "- 字符串里不要用英文双引号，需要引号时用「」。",
    "- 输出必须符合下面这个 JSON Schema：",
    "{{OUTPUT_SCHEMA}}"
  ],
  "input_format": {
    "notes": [
      "frames 里的 <IMAGE_n> 按请求里附带图片的顺序编号，attached_images 是附带的总张数。",
      "auto_checks 来自软件本地的黑屏和静帧检测，单位是秒，按这个版本自己的时间。",
      "must_keep 来自分镜和场记，是这一镜必须保持的连贯要点。"
    ],
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "title": "审片输入",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["task", "attached_images", "shots"],
      "properties": {
        "task": {
          "const": "review_takes"
        },
        "attached_images": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 14
        },
        "shots": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["shot_id", "intent", "takes"],
            "properties": {
              "shot_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^S[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"
              },
              "intent": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "size",
                  "seconds",
                  "action",
                  "characters",
                  "dialogue_lines",
                  "must_keep"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "size": {
                    "enum": ["大远景", "远景", "全景", "中景", "近景", "特写", "大特写"]
                  },
                  "seconds": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 15
                  },
                  "action": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 4,
                    "maxLength": 120
                  },
                  "characters": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 8
                    },
                    "minItems": 0,
                    "maxItems": 6,
                    "uniqueItems": true
                  },
                  "dialogue_lines": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 80
                    },
                    "minItems": 0,
                    "maxItems": 6
                  },
                  "must_keep": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 2,
                      "maxLength": 30
                    },
                    "minItems": 0,
                    "maxItems": 5
                  }
                }
              },
              "takes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": ["take_id", "label", "seconds", "frames", "auto_checks"],
                  "properties": {
                    "take_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^S[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-T[0-9]$"
                    },
                    "label": {
                      "enum": ["A", "B", "C", "D"]
                    },
                    "seconds": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0.5,
                      "maximum": 15
                    },
                    "frames": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "required": ["image", "at_seconds"],
                        "properties": {
                          "image": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "pattern": "^<IMAGE_([1-9]|1[0-4])>$"
                          },
                          "at_seconds": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "maximum": 15
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "minItems": 0,
                      "maxItems": 4
                    },
                    "auto_checks": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "required": ["black", "frozen"],
                      "properties": {
                        "black": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "additionalProperties": false,
                            "required": ["start_seconds", "end_seconds"],
                            "properties": {
                              "start_seconds": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 15
                              },
                              "end_seconds": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 15
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "minItems": 0,
                          "maxItems": 5
                        },
                        "frozen": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "additionalProperties": false,
                            "required": ["start_seconds", "end_seconds"],
                            "properties": {
                              "start_seconds": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 15
                              },
                              "end_seconds": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 15
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "minItems": 0,
                          "maxItems": 5
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "minItems": 2,
                "maxItems": 4
              }
            }
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 7
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "output_format": {
    "notes": [
      "recommend 只是建议，界面上由用户点「用这一版」才生效。",
      "verdict 为 必须重做 的版本不会被推荐。"
    ],
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "title": "审片输出",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["shots"],
      "properties": {
        "shots": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["shot_id", "takes", "recommend", "next_try"],
            "properties": {
              "shot_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^S[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"
              },
              "takes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": ["take_id", "seen_frames", "checks", "verdict", "issues"],
                  "properties": {
                    "take_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^S[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-T[0-9]$"
                    },
                    "seen_frames": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "checks": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "required": ["identity", "action", "artifacts", "continuity"],
                      "properties": {
                        "identity": {
                          "enum": ["过", "不过", "没看到"]
                        },
                        "action": {
                          "enum": ["过", "不过", "没看到"]
                        },
                        "artifacts": {
                          "enum": ["过", "不过", "没看到"]
                        },
                        "continuity": {
                          "enum": ["过", "不过", "没看到"]
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "verdict": {
                      "enum": ["可用", "建议重做", "必须重做"]
                    },
                    "issues": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "required": ["kind", "source", "start_seconds", "end_seconds", "note"],
                        "properties": {
                          "kind": {
                            "enum": [
                              "黑屏",
                              "静帧",
                              "人物不像",
                              "动作不对",
                              "坏画面",
                              "接不上",
                              "没看到画面"
                            ]
                          },
                          "source": {
                            "enum": ["自动检查", "看画面", "没有帧图"]
                          },
                          "start_seconds": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "maximum": 15
                          },
                          "end_seconds": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "maximum": 15
                          },
                          "note": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 2,
                            "maxLength": 40
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "minItems": 0,
                      "maxItems": 8
                    }
                  }
                },
                "minItems": 2,
                "maxItems": 4
              },
              "recommend": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["take_id", "reason"],
                "properties": {
                  "take_id": {
                    "type": ["string", "null"],
                    "pattern": "^S[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-T[0-9]$"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 4,
                    "maxLength": 60
                  }
                }
              },
              "next_try": {
                "type": ["object", "null"],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": ["prompt_change", "keep"],
                "properties": {
                  "prompt_change": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 4,
                    "maxLength": 80
                  },
                  "keep": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 2,
                    "maxLength": 40
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 7
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "review-1",
      "title": "第一章三个镜头各两版：静帧、开头黑屏和点着的烟",
      "input": {
        "task": "review_takes",
        "attached_images": 12,
        "shots": [
          {
            "shot_id": "S01-02",
            "intent": {
              "size": "中景",
              "seconds": 9,
              "action": "从林晚肩后拍沈砚：沈砚滴着水发问，林晚回答时抬手指向最里面那排书架。",
              "characters": ["林晚", "沈砚"],
              "dialogue_lines": [
                "你父亲留下的那本《潮汐表》，还在吗？",
                "在。你这么晚来，就为了一本旧书？"
              ],
              "must_keep": ["林晚在画左背对镜头", "沈砚在画右，夹克往下滴水"]
            },
            "takes": [
              {
                "take_id": "S01-02-T1",
                "label": "A",
                "seconds": 9,
                "frames": [
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_1>",
                    "at_seconds": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_2>",
                    "at_seconds": 6
                  }
                ],
                "auto_checks": {
                  "black": [],
                  "frozen": []
                }
              },
              {
                "take_id": "S01-02-T2",
                "label": "B",
                "seconds": 9,
                "frames": [
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_3>",
                    "at_seconds": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_4>",
                    "at_seconds": 6.5
                  }
                ],
                "auto_checks": {
                  "black": [],
                  "frozen": [
                    {
                      "start_seconds": 6.1,
                      "end_seconds": 7.8
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "shot_id": "S01-04",
            "intent": {
              "size": "近景",
              "seconds": 9,
              "action": "沈砚攥着钥匙回头低声警告；画左前景是林晚虚焦的侧脸，她声音发紧地追问。",
              "characters": ["沈砚", "林晚"],
              "dialogue_lines": [
                "周烈的人在找这个。今晚你别回家。",
                "周烈？",
                "我爸欠他的钱，早就还清了。"
              ],
              "must_keep": ["沈砚右手攥着钥匙", "林晚左眼角有小痣"]
            },
            "takes": [
              {
                "take_id": "S01-04-T1",
                "label": "A",
                "seconds": 9,
                "frames": [
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_5>",
                    "at_seconds": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_6>",
                    "at_seconds": 6
                  }
                ],
                "auto_checks": {
                  "black": [
                    {
                      "start_seconds": 0,
                      "end_seconds": 0.4
                    }
                  ],
                  "frozen": []
                }
              },
              {
                "take_id": "S01-04-T2",
                "label": "B",
                "seconds": 9,
                "frames": [
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_7>",
                    "at_seconds": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_8>",
                    "at_seconds": 6
                  }
                ],
                "auto_checks": {
                  "black": [],
                  "frozen": []
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "shot_id": "S02-06",
            "intent": {
              "size": "中景",
              "seconds": 8,
              "action": "周烈笑着收回手，把烟从嘴里拿下来，在伞柄上磕了磕。",
              "characters": ["周烈"],
              "dialogue_lines": ["凌晨一点，三号码头。钥匙带来，账本的事我就当没发生过。"],
              "must_keep": ["烟没有点着", "周烈左手撑黑伞"]
            },
            "takes": [
              {
                "take_id": "S02-06-T1",
                "label": "A",
                "seconds": 8,
                "frames": [
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_9>",
                    "at_seconds": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "image": "<IMAGE_10>",
                    "at_seconds": 5
                  }
